  "title": "Snapchat Crackdown on AI Slop",
  "summary": "Snapchat has adjusted its recommendation systems to ensure only real-person-created Spotlight content is shown, taking a stance against AI slop, while videos made with AI will no longer appear in public recommendations. Google introduces a selfie video as a new sign-in method for accounts, allowing users to log in even when locked out or can't use their phone or computer.",
